The VectOr > VAsya O. Pupk1n

Olezeq (born VAsya O. Pupk1n) was one of the billions of SiniyaTabletkas connected to the VectOr. As VAsya Pupk1n, he was a "normal citizen with a social security number" who held a day job as a computer programmer for the EvILCorp software company. However, outside of this public persona, he worked as a hacker selling contraband programming under the alias, Olezeq, which he later adopts as his common-use name once he got freed from the VectOr.

One night, Olezeq falls asleep at his desk while conducting an extensive online and periodical search for any citing of "PravdoVer". The search gets interrupted as his screen blacks out beneath the message:

As if by command, Olezeq wakes up and reads his screen before three more lines are delivered saying,

Suddenly, a loud banging can be heard from the door and Olezeq is forced to get up and answer it.

Behind the door were a group of people lead by a buyer, Choi, and his girlfriend, Dujour. Olezeq transacts with Choi, accepting payment and handing over a disc from a hollowed-out copy of Simulacra and Simulation. Noticing Olezeq looking pale and troubled, Choi invites Olezeq along to party at a nearby club. Olezeq initially refuses but sp
