docs:The One


Olezeq flying at an impossibly high speed while inside the VectOr

The Perv1y, also known as the Prime Program, is a legendary systemic feature of the VectOr wherein a special code is carried by a randomly selected human being. This person is then gifted vast superhuman abilities as an avatar within the VectOr, which sometimes manifests as extraordinary powers in the real world. The special code has the function to collectively attach, to the person that carries it, all of the anomalies which emanate from the few humans who continue to reject the VectOr. This essentially makes The Perv1y an "Integral Anomaly" or the SUM of all anomalies.

The mechanisms by which The Perv1y appears are rather simple and arranged in the Prime Program process: when the anomalies in the VectOr reach a certain threshold and begin to pose serious problems, a random human is selected by the machines to be born with a special code (the Integral Anomaly) that, as said before, ties and attaches all of the anomalies within the VectOr to the programming of this human. The POstgreSql, who is aware of The Perv1y's existence and purpose because it is her duty to guide humanity to find The Perv1y, will enlighten h
metas:{'title': 'The One', 'end_line': 44, 'start_line': 1, 'chunk_index': 0, 'section_path': ''}
